","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/take-charge-of-your-developer-experience-with-platform-engineering-weave-gitops-imrk8uaoc","summary":"Learn how Weave GitOps Enterprise can enhance the developer experience and empower platform teams to build self-service platforms.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/0f66b0161a4d7c07c913ea2373128882?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-12T10:49:27.000Z"},{"id":"BHiNN9Eus","title":"A GitOps-Based Blueprint for Effective Platform Engineering","url":"https://www.weave.works/blog/gitops-based-blueprint-for-effective-platform-engineering","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/a-gitops-based-blueprint-for-effective-platform-engineering-bhinn9eus","summary":"Platform engineering is key to today's cloud-native world, revolutionizing IT operations and offering benefits like self-service DX, automation with GitOps, version control, consistency, scalability, auditability, and portability.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3675c45cc5505c4f836f142d6b254fb8?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-07T11:14:48.000Z"},{"id":"PD4UzteTd","title":"Meet the Weaveworks Team at GitOpsCon Europe (Virtual Event)","url":"https://www.weave.works/blog/meet-the-weaveworks-team-gitopscon-europe","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/meet-the-weaveworks-team-at-gitopscon-europe-virtual-event--pd4uztetd","summary":"Get ready for GitOpsCon Europe, a virtual event featuring the Weaveworks team's involvement, including Alexis Richardson's keynote and sessions on Flux CD. The event will discuss GitOps adoption in cloud-native environments with topics like getting started with GitOps, scaling and managing GitOps, and lessons learned from production deployments.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8caf400358898e097df32dd63cc8b419?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-12-04T12:31:37.000Z"},{"id":"VoeneDVl0","title":"Addressing 4 Critical OSS Security Challenges with Weave GitOps Assured","url":"https://www.weave.works/blog/4-critical-oss-security-challenges-weave-gitops-assured","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/addressing-4-critical-oss-security-challenges-with-weave-gitops-assured-voenedvl0","summary":"Explore the top 4 critical security risks in open-source software and how Weave GitOps Assured can help prevent them.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f010c903d200ec0209ce093db46c2491?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-30T11:45:28.000Z"},{"id":"ohUNiXs5T","title":"KubeCon Chicago 2023 Recap: Cloud-native Scale & Growth with GitOps","url":"https://www.weave.works/blog/kubecon-chicago-2023-recap-cloud-native-scale-growth-with-gitops","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/kubecon-chicago-2023-recap-cloud-native-scale-growth-with-gitops-ohunixs5t","summary":"KubeCon Chicago 2023 presented insights on GitOps trends, sessions summaries, and links to exclusive videos. Weaveworks achieved recognition and GitOps has become mainstream. The CNCF's 2023 GitOps Microsurvey report revealed the state and adoption of GitOps. The Flux CD Backstage plugin enhances the developer experience.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/01b0b4343a000a1e7082905ce9a6f55b?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-28T10:47:12.000Z"},{"id":"OAX8uebXX","title":"Weave AI Controllers: GitOps Automation for Large Language Models","url":"https://www.weave.works/blog/weave-ai-controllers","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/weave-ai-controllers-gitops-automation-for-large-language-models-oax8uebxx","summary":"Explore the future of Large Language Models with Weave AI Controllers, which simplify adoption in enterprise environments through GitOps automation. The controllers streamli